<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 23.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 23.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali discussed with Agriculture Minister Mohamed Ben Rejeb a project of strategy for the development of the cereals sector over the next 10 years.</p>
<p>- Polish Foreign Affairs Minister Dariusz Rosati to visit Tunis on November 25-26.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President's wife Leila Ben Ali inaugurated a charity bazar in Tunis.</p>
</text>
